Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:22:01.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}因为是从“零”开始 和你一同走来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:06.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}感觉即使是空想也可以实现
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}难以置信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}想必明天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.98,0:22:27.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}还会继续像今天一样的生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:30.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}啊已经为此忧郁了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}一直远远地凝望着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.45,0:22:39.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}海上升起的明月今天也超越了时空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:42.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}啊它已经沉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:45.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}我不想伤害别人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:46.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}可是太难熬了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:48.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}我不想这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:53.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}你的微笑才是解开诅咒的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:59.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}因为是从“零”开始 和你一同走来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:05.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}感觉似乎可以发自内心地笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:11.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}希望就这样子明天后天也不变
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:14.71,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}我还想听见你真实的心声
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.85,0:23:17.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}我还想更加了解你的喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:19.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}在我的面前就不必隐藏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.13,0:23:23.98,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fax0.1\fad(100,100)\blur3\bord4\3c&HF1B0FD&}让我们从“零”走到“一”吧
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.80,0:22:01.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}因为是从“零”开始 和你一同走来
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.19,0:22:06.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}感觉即使是空想也可以实现
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}难以置信吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}想必明天
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.98,0:22:27.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}还会继续像今天一样的生活吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.64,0:22:30.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}啊已经为此忧郁了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}一直远远地凝望着
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.45,0:22:39.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}海上升起的明月今天也超越了时空
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.26,0:22:42.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}啊它已经沉下去了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.05,0:22:45.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}我不想伤害别人
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.03,0:22:46.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}可是太难熬了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.72,0:22:48.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}我不想这样下去
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.64,0:22:53.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax0.1\fad(100,100)}你的微笑才是解开诅咒的魔法
